Rule 8 (If pad length is not according to ndim, it is invalid except constant)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int), v_3 : str} |= if (ndim(v_1) = 2 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = 2) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 2 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = 4) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 3 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = 2) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 3 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = 4) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 3 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = 6) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = 4) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = 6) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = 8) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 5 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = 6) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 5 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = 8) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 5 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = 10) then true else if v_3 = "constant" then true else false
