Rule 10 (If reflect or replicate, the dimension size has to be greater than 0)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int), v_3 : str} |= if v_3 = "reflect" ∨ v_3 = "replicate" then ∀i ∈ [0, shape(v_2, 0) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
