Rule 11 (Padding can only be applied to last ndim/2 dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= ∀i ∈ [0, shape(v_2, 0) / 2 - 1] : shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - i) > 0
